			</div>
			<section class="entry-content">
				<!-- Template -->
				<p style="text-align: center"><span style="color: #ff0000"><strong><span style="font-size: 26px">(PDF)<a style="color: #ff0000" href="https://wgs.wku.ac.kr/wp-content/uploads/sites/93/2026/04/원광대학교_일반대학원_2026_후기_외국인전형모집요강.pdf">원광대학교_일반대학원_2026학년도_후기_외국인전형 </a></span></strong></span></p>
<p style="text-align: center"><span style="color: #ff0000"><strong><span style="font-size: 26px"><a style="color: #ff0000" href="https://wgs.wku.ac.kr/wp-content/uploads/sites/93/2026/04/원광대학교_일반대학원_2026_후기_외국인전형모집요강.pdf">Admissions Guidelines_(KOR)</a></span></strong></span></p>
<h3 style="text-align: center"><span style="color: #000000;font-size: 22px"><strong><a href="https://wgs.wku.ac.kr/?p=3514" target="_self" class="ico link">외국인 신입학 제출서류 관련양식 바로가기</a></strong></span></h3>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p style="text-align: center"><span style="font-size: 24px"><strong><span style="color: #0000ff"><a style="color: #0000ff" href="https://wgs.wku.ac.kr/wp-content/uploads/sites/93/2025/10/붙임_외국인원서접수_Online_Application_Manual_eng.pdf">★ 외국인원서접수_Online_Application_Manual_eng_ENG 영문</a></span></strong></span></p>
<p style="text-align: center"><span style="font-size: 24px"><strong><span style="color: #ff0000"><a style="color: #ff0000" href="https://wgs.wku.ac.kr/wp-content/uploads/sites/93/2025/10/붙임_외국인원서접수_Online_Application_Manual_kor.pdf">★ 외국인원서접수_Online_Application_Manual_kor_KOR 한글</a></span></strong></span></p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<h3 data-start="49" data-end="93"><span style="font-size: 24px">📢 [원광대학교 일반대학원] 2026학년도 후기(2차) 모집 일정 안내</span></h3>
<p data-start="95" data-end="164"><span style="font-size: 24px">안녕하세요.</span><br data-start="101" data-end="104" /><span style="font-size: 24px">원광대학교 <strong><span style="color: #0000ff">일반대학원</span></strong>입니다.</span></p>
<h3 data-start="49" data-end="93"><span style="font-size: 24px">2026학년도 후기(2차) </span><span style="font-size: 24px">일반대학원 모집 일정을 아래와 같이 안내드립니다.</span></h3>
<h3 data-start="49" data-end="93"> </h3>
<hr data-start="166" data-end="169" />
<h4 data-start="171" data-end="191"><span style="font-size: 24px">📌 1. 원서접수 기간</span></h4>
<ul data-start="192" data-end="256">
<li data-start="192" data-end="256">
<p data-start="194" data-end="256"><span style="font-size: 24px"><strong data-start="194" data-end="224">2026.06.22(월) ~ 06.26.(금)</strong></span><br data-start="224" data-end="227" /><span style="font-size: 24px">※ 자세한 내용은 모집요강을 참고해 주시기 바랍니다.</span></p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="258" data-end="261" />
<h4 data-start="263" data-end="283"><span style="font-size: 24px">📌 2. 서류제출 기간</span></h4>
<ul data-start="284" data-end="316">
<li data-start="284" data-end="316">
<p data-start="286" data-end="316"><span style="font-size: 24px"><strong data-start="194" data-end="224">2026.06.22(월) ~ 06.26.(금)</strong></span></p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="318" data-end="321" />
<h4 data-start="461" data-end="479"><span style="font-size: 24px">📌 3. 면접 일정</span></h4>
<ul data-start="480" data-end="536">
<li data-start="480" data-end="536">
<p data-start="482" data-end="536"><span style="font-size: 24px"><strong data-start="482" data-end="512">2026.07.13(월) ~ 07.15(수) </strong></span><br data-start="512" data-end="515" /><span style="font-size: 24px">※ 학과별 면접 시간은 별도 공지 예정</span></p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="538" data-end="541" />
<h4 data-start="543" data-end="562"><span style="font-size: 24px">📌 4. 합격자 발표</span></h4>
<ul>
<li><span style="font-size: 24px"><strong data-start="565" data-end="583">1차지원자 : 2026.06.18.</strong></span><span style="font-size: 24px"><strong data-start="565" data-end="583">(목)</strong></span></li>
</ul>
<ul data-start="563" data-end="583">
<li data-start="563" data-end="583">
<p data-start="565" data-end="583"><span style="font-size: 24px"><strong data-start="565" data-end="583">2차지원자 : 2026.07.22.</strong></span><span style="font-size: 24px"><strong data-start="565" data-end="583">(수)</strong></span></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<hr data-start="585" data-end="588" />
<h4 data-start="590" data-end="609"><span style="font-size: 24px">📌 5. 합격자 등록</span></h4>
<ul data-start="610" data-end="697">
<li data-start="610" data-end="651">
<p data-start="612" data-end="651"><strong><span style="font-size: 24px">등록 기간(1차 지원자) : 2026.07.06.(월) ~ 07.08.(수)</span></strong></p>
</li>
<li><strong><span style="font-size: 24px">등록 기간(2차 지원자) : 2026.08.03(월) ~ 08.05(수)</span></strong><strong style="font-size: 24px"> </strong></li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="699" data-end="702" />
<p style="text-align: center" data-start="704" data-end="764"><span style="font-size: 24px"><strong>📞 문의처: 원광대학교 대학원 교학과</strong></span><br data-start="725" data-end="728" /><span style="font-size: 24px"><strong>☎ 063-850-5118 / ✉ <a class="cursor-pointer" rel="noopener" data-start="747" data-end="764">won5118@wku.ac.kr</a></strong></span></p>
